<refentry version="5.1"
  xml:id="Api.SilikoLexer"
  xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook">
<refmeta>
  <refentrytitle>SilikoLexer</refentrytitle>
</refmeta>

<refnamediv>
  <refname><type>SilikoLexer</type></refname>
  <refpurpose>Type represzenting a lexical analyzer</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Lexer.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">typedef /* ... */ SilikoLexer;</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>A <type>SilikoLexer</type> is a tool used to lexically analize
input from a <type>SilikoInput</type>, and converts the input to a
sequence of meaningful tokens as <type>SilikoToken</type>
objects.</para>
</refsection>
</refentry>
